        "data": {
          "comment": "# One Tagline, Six Markets\n\nTranslates a tagline into six languages and adds an English back-translation for each. Someone who reads none of the languages can still check what each version says.\n\n**How it works:** Type the tagline into \"Input\". \"Agent\" writes it in German, French, Spanish, Italian, Japanese and Brazilian Portuguese, each followed by a literal English back-translation in brackets. \"Output\" shows the list.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Agent\", then edit its system prompt to swap Italian for Korean."
